{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25803","headline":"过梅里七首  家於无锡四十载今敝庐数堵犹存今列题於後 忆题惠山寺书堂 · 李绅","name":"过梅里七首  家於无锡四十载今敝庐数堵犹存今列题於後 忆题惠山寺书堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故山一别光阴改，秋露清风岁月多。\n松下壮心年少去，池边衰影老人过。\n白云生灭依岩岫，青桂荣枯托薜萝。\n惟有此身长是客，又驱旌斾寄烟波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}